\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {IV}{\ignorespaces Ablation: what happens if you drop each feature? Frequency is non-negotiable. Reputation barely helps. The model relies on a small number of strong signals.}}{4}{table.4}\protected@file@percent }
